WEBVTT

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:59.700
The secret of the stone
tablet has been revealed.

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:05.100
It was the ancestors of Ozma's group
who sealed Sacred Beasts inside of it.

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:12.480
No!

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.820
Now it's my turn!

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.960
Shortly after, Rei was
defeated by Dunga,

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.770
and lost Byakko.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.800
Byakko!
Return to the tablet!

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:14.500
We finally sealed Byakko.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:15.620
Shoot!

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:21.260
After seeing Rei lose,
Takao and the others practiced hard.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:24.530
To get Rei's Byakko back, of course.

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:36.420
--Go, Shoot!

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:41.340
Go, Dragoon!

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.700
Don't lose, Draciel!

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.120
They're really into it...

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:57.380
Rei...

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:02.090
I promise we'll get Byakko back.
Just you wait.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:07.360
Takao!

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:13.980
Seiryu!!

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:23.950
Genbu!!

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:32.960
What is that...?

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:15.590
That was awesome!

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:19.020
Zeo, when did
you get here?

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:20.690
Takao!

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:21.920
What is it?

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:25.600
What was that thing that
came out of your Beyblade?

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:26.390
Huh?!

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:31.090
The one from yours
looked like a dragon!

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:33.700
And Max's had
a turtle, right?

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:35.350
Yeah...

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.910
Zeo, you can see
our Sacred Beasts, too?

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:41.940
Sacred Beasts? Is that
what they're called?

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.860
So you really
saw them, Zeo?

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:44.900
Yeah!

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:47.840
So Zeo can see the
Sacred Beasts, too?

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:49.560
This is a new discovery!

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:51.970
Can I see your Beyblade?

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:53.090
Sure...

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:57.930
This is it!

00:05:57.930 --> 00:06:00.150
It's so cool!

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:02.490
So you've got one too, Max?

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:03.970
Huh? Yeah.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:07.050
Yeah, that's the turtle I saw!

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:11.450
So Kai and Rei's Beyblades
have Sacred Beasts too, right?

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:18.720
Alright, that's enough.
Back to practice.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:23.180
I want a Sacred Beast
in my Beyblade, too.

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:27.900
So how do I get a Beyblade
with a Sacred Beast in it?

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:31.990
I want one too, so I can be
strong like all of you guys!

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:35.790
If you want to get stronger,
just improve your skills.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:40.730
But if you have a Sacred Beast
you can become way stronger--

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:44.130
Zeo! You don't have what it
takes to own a Sacred Beast.

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:47.220
What it takes...?

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:50.850
He won't understand a
thing about Sacred Beasts, Kai.

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:52.820
It might be a little out of
Zeo's league right now.

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:54.900
Let's get back to practicing.

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:55.800
Okay.

00:06:57.320 --> 00:06:58.730
Hey, wait!

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:00.670
Rei...

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:05.420
Our Sacred Beasts aren't playthings
to make our Beyblades stronger.

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:07.350
That's all.

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:18.660
Go!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:19.910
That's it!

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:30.370
What is a
Sacred Beast, anyway?

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:36.520
Aren't they just in your
Bey to help you win battles?

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:40.620
Right! Back then, too!

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:49.180
Rise, my Sacred Beast!

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:00.700
Come to think of it, that
was a Sacred Beast, too.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:11.280
That's it!

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:14.420
Go, Driger!

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:30.740
But Rei said that Sacred Beasts aren't
playthings to make Beyblades stronger.

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:33.140
So what is a Sacred
Beast for, then?

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:38.000
Yay! I won!

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:41.610
I'm a shoo-in to win
tomorrow's junior tournament!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:45.790
I'm gonna win and get a
trophy from Takao Kinomiya!

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:49.250
What the heck is
a Sacred Beast?

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.990
Please tell me, Takao...

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:08.800
What are you doing, Doctor?!

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:10.680
Isn't it obvious?

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:13.500
I'm extracting a Sacred
Beast from the stone tablet.

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:17.300
Is Doctor Zagart aware of this?

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:18.660
No, he isn't.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:22.040
Do you understand what
it is you're doing, Doctor?!

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:26.940
One of the four Sacred Beasts has
been stolen by those four kids.

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:31.410
But the Doctor isn't
doing anything about it.

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:34.180
That's true, but...

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:40.210
I will obtain the
remaining three by myself.

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:42.400
This is the only option.

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:06.550
Engage the transplantation system!

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:07.940
Yes ma'am!

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:26.180
Transplantation system, complete!

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:36.500
You may enter, Net.

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:41.600
Who the hell are you?!

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:53.420
This is Net. A Blader who will be
a perfect fit for this Beyblade.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.660
Your target is
Takao Kinomiya's Seiryu.

00:10:57.660 --> 00:11:03.300
He will be a guest at
tomorrow's junior tournament.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:08.270
Your perfect chance to attack
will be when Kinomiya is alone.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:14.340
You can do as you please, as long
as you steal his Sacred Beast, Net.

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:17.490
Leave it to me, Doctor.

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:22.320
I'm going to crush Takao Kinomiya,
and pluck Seiryu right from his hands.

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:38.300
It's almost time to begin.

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:41.620
Players, please return to
the designated area.

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:49.230
I told him to arrive to the
arena 30 minutes before start...

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:52.900
What's Kinomiya up to, I wonder?

00:11:53.300 --> 00:11:55.280
Oh, crap!!

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:57.700
I am so late!

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:06.120
Takao, wait up!

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:12.020
A Beyblade?!

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:20.530
Who are you?!

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:29.060
Who the heck are you?

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:47.390
Who are you?

00:12:48.610 --> 00:12:53.120
I'm Net. I'm here to
take your Seiryu.

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:57.970
What?! So you're a part of the group
after our four Sacred Beasts?

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:01.460
If you get it, then that
makes my job easier.

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:05.050
Try and take him if you dare!

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:08.390
Then allow me!

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:10.040
Not a chance!

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:18.960
Go, Dragoon!
Beat him to a pulp!

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:23.290
Yeah!

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:33.730
What're you doing?!
Our battle isn't over yet!

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:37.290
Hey!

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:40.340
Get back here!

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.530
Darn it! Dragoon!

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:51.440
What is this place?

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.920
This place gives
me the creeps...

00:13:58.760 --> 00:14:00.540
Don't jump out like that!

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:04.710
This will be the graveyard
for you and Seiryu.

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:06.500
Fitting, isn't it?

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:07.780
What?!

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:10.100
Eat this!

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:22.220
Dragoon! Don't lose to him!

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:25.570
Go, Dragoon!

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:36.130
Summon Seiryu, Kinomiya!

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:39.180
I don't need Seiryu to beat you!

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:40.700
Takao!

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:43.010
Go, Dragoon!

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:48.820
That move won't work on me.

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:50.620
Spider!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:03.810
What?!

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:07.010
If you won't summon it,
I'll make you!

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:10.980
Spider!!

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:17.230
A Sacred Beast?!

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:24.730
Seiryu!!

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:39.950
You finally summoned it! That means
it's the end for Seiryu and Dragoon!

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:42.930
Get real! You don't
get to decide that!

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:45.810
Go, Spider!!

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:47.720
Seiryu!!

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:06.850
I did it!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:13.410
Spider, counterattack!

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:17.250
What?!

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:28.910
Seiryu!

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:37.570
Darn it!

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:42.240
Seiryu's as good as finished!

00:16:42.820 --> 00:16:44.980
I won't let...

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:48.030
Someone like you take Seiryu!

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.350
Is he trying to take Seiryu?

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:00.850
I won't let him!

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:03.250
Who are you?

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.100
Zeo!

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:06.920
I'll protect Takao's Seiryu!

00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:14.520
Little punk!
Stay out of this!!

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:27.100
Spider!

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:40.290
Keep it up, Net!

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:43.310
Catch him! Catch Seiryu!

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:57.400
More, Spider!
Make Seiryu suffer more!

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:12.260
Zeo!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:15.350
Don't mess with us!

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:16.960
Dragoon!

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:26.460
What?!

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:44.620
Seiryu!!

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:51.600
Wow...!

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:53.570
Their teamwork
is incredible...

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:19.870
You did it!
You really did it!

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:22.130
Takao, you won! Yes!

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:28.280
You won! You won!

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:32.650
Hey! You okay?
Let me see.

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:35.420
It doesn't look
serious, thankfully.

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:36.200
Yeah.

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:38.530
Uh-oh!!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:40.720
I totally forgot!

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:41.990
Takao!

00:19:46.270 --> 00:19:51.120
Thank you for waiting. We now
present the trophy to the winner!

00:19:54.310 --> 00:19:57.250
And the presenter is, umm...

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.200
The one and only!

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:02.030
Takao Kinomiya!

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:05.250
Kinomiya!
Where were you?

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:08.720
Don't sweat the details.
I made it!

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:11.380
Congrats.

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:12.810
Thank you!

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:18.050
Goodness...

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:22.400
I owe all of you
an apology.

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:27.000
After seeing Takao battle today,

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:31.410
I understand what Rei told me.

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:36.600
Sacred Beasts aren't playthings
to make Beyblades stronger.

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:40.880
And yet, even though
I know nothing...

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.930
What I said was inconsiderate.

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:50.050
If I had a Beyblade with a Sacred Beast in it,
I felt like I'd be closer to becoming your friend.

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:51.700
And that's why...

00:20:52.990 --> 00:20:54.530
I'm truly sorry!

00:20:54.530 --> 00:20:56.980
Even without a Sacred Beast.

00:20:57.350 --> 00:21:00.610
You're already
one of our friends.

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:05.020
Kai...

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:09.650
Okay, time for practice!

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.520
Zeo, would you
like to battle me?

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:14.450
Huh?

00:21:14.550 --> 00:21:16.710
Come on, let's
go a round, Zeo!

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:20.620
Yeah!

00:21:21.310 --> 00:21:22.690
Here I come.

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:23.760
Yeah.

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:27.690
--Three! Two! One!

00:21:27.690 --> 00:21:30.500
--Go, Shoot!

00:23:01.060 --> 00:23:03.100
A fearsome opponent
has appeared before us.

00:23:03.100 --> 00:23:07.680
He'll cut your Bey in two with a
Sacred Beast hidden in the wind.

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:10.170
Kai challenges him, and...

00:23:10.170 --> 00:23:13.360
Oh? You don't like
the wind, Chairman?

00:23:13.360 --> 00:23:15.070
Your hair gets exposed?

00:23:15.070 --> 00:23:17.090
Not the same joke again!

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:18.980
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:23:18.980 --> 00:23:21.200
Make sure to watch
the next episode, too!
